       In addition, if this is the first time You have received notice of
       a violation of this license from the Licensor, and You cure the
       violation within thirty (30) days after receiving that notice, Your
       license is reinstated permanently.

  12.3 Upon termination, You must stop using, reproducing, modifying and
       distributing the Software and all Modified Versions. Termination
